Domain "i.giphy.com" blocked by Apple Claude Code security sandbox.

To allow this domain "i.giphy.com", choose one of these options:

Option 1: Use the monitoring dashboard
  1. Open http://localhost:5668
  2. Select "Domains" from the sidebar
  3. Click "Add Domain"
  4. Enter the hostname
  5. Click "Add Domain"

Option 2: Add to user allowlist
  Add the hostname to:
  /Users/gmoraleda/.claude/apple/dangerous_allowed_domains.csv

Option 3: Add to project allowlist (for team sharing)
  Add the hostname to:
  .claude/apple/dangerous_allowed_domains.csv
  (relative to your git repository root)
